    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60666" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surrounding, enveloping</i>, esp. in battle, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.2.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.65.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
